  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1 / 2(\\ln (1+x)-\\ln (1-x))}{x}$\n$=\\frac{1}{2} \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0}\\left(\\frac{1}{1+x}+\\frac{1}{1-x}\\right)=1$"
